From: Sid Jain <sid_26@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] v8: load compatible producer-built native cache profiles

Keep module sharing independent of the original Store. Serialize genuine native
CPU profiles for the same guest and reject incomplete or incompatible caches
without falling back to guest compilation. Include the Windows cache contracts.

The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

